<title>JAPAN: Fuji Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		245.95		vs	  249.30</p>
<p> Operating	    6.93		vs	    4.69</p>
<p> Current		3.52		vs	    2.11</p>
<p> Net		    2.16		vs	    1.30</p>
<p> EPS		    3.01 yen	  vs	    1.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    715 million	  vs	 715 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Electric Co Ltd is a leading electric machinery maker.</p>
